\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # Climate, Human Exposure, and Shark Incident Trends\
\
This project investigates how shark incident trends relate to climate patterns, population growth, and human coastal exposure.\
\
## Core Question\
\
Are shark incident trends better explained by environmental change, human exposure, or both?\
\
## Current Data Files\
\
- Shark incident data\
- Florida population data\
- Global temperature anomaly data\
- Sea surface temperature data\
\
